* LT3045-1 Ultralow Noise LDO : 5V IN -> 3.3V OUT @ 100mA
* ---------------------------------------------------------------
* Vout = ISET(100uA) * RSET  ->  RSET = 33k for 3.300V
* ---------------------------------------------------------------

.lib LT3045-1.sub

* ---------------- Input source (soft ramp for convergence) -------
VIN IN 0 PWL(0 0 100u 5) DC 5

* ---------------- Input / output capacitors ---------------------
CIN  IN  0 10u
COUT OUT 0 10u

* ---------------- Regulator ------------------------------------
* Pin order: IN OUT OUTS SET ILIM PG EN/UV GND
* OUTS tied to OUT (local sense), EN/UV tied to IN (always enabled)
XU1 IN OUT OUT SET ILIM PG IN 0 LT3045-1

* Output voltage program resistor + reference bypass cap
RSET SET 0 33k
CSET SET 0 10n

* Current limit pin left at internal maximum (high-Z tie for DC path)
RILIM ILIM 0 1G

* Power-good open-collector output with pull-up
RPG PG OUT 100k

* ---------------- Load : 3.3V / 33 ohm = 100mA ------------------
RLOAD OUT 0 33

* ---------------- Analysis -------------------------------------
.tran 0 5m 0 1u startup
.meas TRAN vout_dc AVG V(OUT) FROM 4m TO 5m
.meas TRAN iload  AVG I(RLOAD) FROM 4m TO 5m
.meas TRAN vdrop  PARAM 5-0
.options plotwinsize=0 reltol=1e-4

.end
